# Project Stack — Pizzaria Backend

REST API built with **Node.js + TypeScript + Express 5**, run in development via **tsx** (no pre-compilation step required for dev).

## Runtime and tooling

| Tool | Version | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Node.js | **22.x** (local: 22.14.0) | Express 5 requires `>= 18` |
| npm | **10.x** (local: 10.9.2) | lockfile v3 |
| TypeScript (runtime) | via **tsx 4.22.4** | Transpiles with esbuild; **does not type-check** |
| TypeScript (compiler) | **typescript** (devDependency) | Use `npm run typecheck` for static analysis |

