## Known gaps

1. No `build`/`start` scripts yet — add when deploying to production.
2. No test framework — when adding one, prefer **Vitest** or **Node test runner** (compatible with tsx/ESM).

## When adding new dependencies

- Keep `@types/*` aligned with the package major version (e.g. Express 5 → `@types/express` 5.x)
- Express 5 already includes JSON parsing — avoid duplicating unnecessary middleware
- Prefer packages with Node >= 18 support
- Update this rule when the stack changes (new DB, ORM, validation, etc.)
